@sturzo_1919
face-image: img/portraits/LuigiSturzo.jpg
on-arrival: ppi_left += 2;

As expected, Luigi Sturzo has been elected as the first Secretary General of the <span style="font-weight: bold; color:#87CEFA;">Italian People's Party</span>. He represents the more progressive faction of the party, willing to cooperate with us, and we are optimistic we will be able to cooperate.